---
// CTA.astro
---

<section class="py-20 relative overflow-hidden border-t border-slate-900 bg-slate-950">
  <!-- Glowing effects -->
  <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[600px] h-[300px] bg-brand-500/10 rounded-full blur-[100px] pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center relative z-10">
    <div class="rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-r from-slate-900 via-slate-900 to-brand-950/30 p-12 border border-slate-800 space-y-8 shadow-2xl">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white">
        Pronto para realçar a sua beleza?
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-300 max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Não perca tempo em linhas de espera. Escolha o serviço, veja os horários livres e garanta o seu atendimento agora mesmo.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
        <a
          href="http://localhost:3000/agendar"
          class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-600 to-pink-600 px-8 py-4 text-base font-semibold text-white shadow-xl shadow-brand-500/20 hover:from-brand-500 hover:to-pink-500 transition-all hover:scale-[1.03] active:scale-[0.98]"
        >
          Marcar Meu Horário
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="w-5 h-5">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 4.5L21 12m0 0l-7.5 7.5M21 12H3" />
          </svg>
        </a>
        <a
          href="#contato"
          class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/50 hover:bg-slate-900/80 px-8 py-4 text-base font-semibold text-slate-300 transition-all"
        >
          Falar Conosco
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
